#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:4
msgid "Synthetic Data Generation and Imitation Learning with Isaac Lab Mimic"
msgstr "使用 Isaac Lab Mimic 进行合成数据生成与模仿学习"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:7
msgid "Isaac Lab Mimic is only supported on Linux."
msgstr "Isaac Lab Mimic 仅支持 Linux。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:10
msgid "What is Isaac Lab Mimic?"
msgstr "什么是 Isaac Lab Mimic？"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:12
#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:410
msgid "Franka robot performing a stacking task"
msgstr "Franka 机器人执行堆叠任务"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:18
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab Mimic (Mimic) is a trajectory data generation tool that can be "
"used to augment human demonstrations by generating new synthetic data. Given"
" a set of human demonstrations, Mimic can automatically generate new "
"demonstrations involving the same task but with different spatial "
"configurations. The generated data can be used to train imitation learning "
"policies that are more robust to spatial variations even if just a handful "
"of manual demonstrations are available."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab Mimic（Mimic）是一种轨迹数据生成工具，通过生成新的合成数据来扩充人类示范。给定一组人类示范，Mimic "
"可以自动生成任务相同、空间配置不同的新示范。即使只有少量手动示范，生成的数据也能用于训练更能适应空间变化的模仿学习策略。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:24
msgid ""
"Mimic works by taking a set of human demonstrations and splitting each "
"demonstration into a sequence of subtasks. Subtasks are defined based on "
"reference objects that dictate the motion of the robot's end-effectors "
"(eefs). Each subtask is a contiguous segment of the demonstration where the "
"eef's motion is dictated by a single reference object. A new subtask begins "
"when the reference object changes. Annotations mark points in the "
"demonstration where a subtask is completed."
msgstr ""
"Mimic "
"将每条人类示范拆分为一系列子任务。子任务按决定机器人末端执行器（eef）运动的参考物体定义：每个子任务都是示范中的连续片段，期间末端运动由单个参考物体决定。参考物体变化时，新的子任务开始。标注用于指出示范中各子任务完成的位置。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:29
msgid ""
"During data generation, Mimic takes the human demonstration subtask segments"
" and applies rigid body transformations to the robot's actions to transform "
"them into new demonstrations involving the same task but with different "
"spatial configurations. The new demonstrations are evaluated to determine if"
" they are successful, and if so, are added to the output dataset."
msgstr ""
"数据生成时，Mimic "
"使用人类示范的子任务片段，对机器人动作施加刚体变换，得到任务相同、空间配置不同的新示范。系统会评估新示范是否成功，成功的示范会加入输出数据集。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:33
msgid ""
"Mimic is compatible with a variety of embodiments including single-eef (e.g."
" manipulator robots) and multi-eef (e.g. humanoid robots). The use of rigid "
"body transformations requires that the embodiment's action space is defined "
"in **task space**. If the embodiment's action is in joint space, then the "
"action must be converted to task space using forward kinematics."
msgstr ""
"Mimic 兼容多种机器人形态，包括单末端执行器（如机械臂）和多末端执行器（如人形机器人）。刚体变换要求机器人的动作空间定义在 **任务空间** "
"中。如果动作定义在关节空间中，必须通过正向运动学将其转换到任务空间。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:37
msgid ""
"In the following sections, we will show how to collect a small batch of "
"human demonstrations for a stacking task with the Franka robot, increase the"
" size of the dataset by generating new synthetic data using Isaac Lab Mimic,"
" and lastly train a policy to perform the stacking task."
msgstr ""
"以下各节将介绍如何为 Franka 机器人堆叠任务采集少量人类示范，使用 Isaac Lab Mimic "
"生成新的合成数据扩充数据集，最后训练执行堆叠任务的策略。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:46
msgid "Step 1: Human Data Collection"
msgstr "步骤 1：采集人类示范数据"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:49
msgid ""
"You may skip this step and proceed directly to :ref:`Step 2: Synthetic Data "
"Generation using Isaac Lab Mimic <teleop-imitation-step-2-synthetic-data>` "
"if you do not wish to collect your own demonstrations."
msgstr ""
"如果不想自行采集示范，可以跳过此步骤，直接进入 :ref:`步骤 2：使用 Isaac Lab Mimic 生成合成数据 <teleop-"
"imitation-step-2-synthetic-data>` 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:55
msgid "Environment Introduction"
msgstr "环境介绍"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:57
msgid ""
"The environment we will be using in this tutorial is ``IsaacContrib-Stack-"
"Cube-Franka-IK-Rel`` and its variations. This environment contains a Franka "
"robot attached to a table with three cubes. The task is to stack the cubes "
"in the following order: blue (bottom), red (middle), green (top). As you "
"proceed through the rest of this tutorial, you will encounter variations of "
"this environment with different observation spaces (e.g. state-based, "
"visuomotor, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"本教程使用 ``IsaacContrib-Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-Rel`` 环境及其变体。场景中有一台固定在桌上的 Franka "
"机器人及三个立方体。任务是按以下顺序堆叠：蓝色在底部、红色在中间、绿色在顶部。教程后续会使用观测空间不同的环境变体，如基于状态的观测、视觉运动观测等。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:63
msgid ""
"Run the following command to spin up and visualize the environment using the"
" ``zero_agent.py`` script provided by Isaac Lab. This script create and step"
" through the environment in a loop with zero tensor actions. You will see "
"the robot remain stationary while the environment is running. Use the scroll"
" wheel to zoom in and out of the scene. Press and hold the alt key while "
"clicking and dragging to pan around the scene."
msgstr ""
"运行以下命令，通过 Isaac Lab 提供的 ``zero_agent.py`` "
"脚本启动环境并显示场景。脚本在循环中创建环境，以全零张量动作推进仿真，运行时机器人会保持不动。滚动鼠标滚轮可缩放场景；按住 Alt "
"键并点击拖动，可调整场景视图。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:77
msgid ""
"Next, use the ``random_agent.py`` script to spin up the environment and "
"perform random actions. The script will create and step through the "
"environment in a loop with random tensor actions. You will see the robot "
"move in random directions."
msgstr ""
"接下来，使用 ``random_agent.py`` "
"启动环境并执行随机动作。脚本在循环中创建环境，以随机张量动作推进仿真，可以看到机器人向随机方向移动。"

