"`SpaceMouse Compact <https://3dconnexion.com/us/product/spacemouse-"
"compact/>`__ 和 `SpaceMouse Wireless "
"<https://3dconnexion.com/us/product/spacemouse-wireless/>`__ 。使用时只需相应修改 "
"``--teleop_device`` ："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:148
msgid ""
"The script will print a helper message with key bindings. For SpaceMouse, "
"the key bindings are:"
msgstr "脚本会打印按键帮助。SpaceMouse 的按键绑定如下："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:162
msgid ""
"If the SpaceMouse is not detected, you most likely need additional user "
"permissions. The ``hidapi`` wheel installed by Isaac Lab bundles a backend "
"that talks to the device over ``libusb``, so it needs read and write access "
"to the USB node under ``/dev/bus/usb`` -- granting access to "
"``/dev/hidraw*`` alone is **not** sufficient, and without USB access the "
"device is enumerated without a product name."
msgstr ""
"如果检测不到 SpaceMouse，通常是用户权限不足。Isaac Lab 安装的 ``hidapi`` wheel 附带通过 ``libusb`` "
"与设备通信的后端，因此需要对 ``/dev/bus/usb`` 下的 USB 节点具有读写权限。仅授予 ``/dev/hidraw*`` 权限 "
"**并不够** ；没有 USB 访问权限时，设备虽能被枚举，但没有产品名称。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:167
msgid ""
"Grant the permission by installing a udev rule for the 3Dconnexion vendor "
"id:"
msgstr "为 3Dconnexion 厂商 ID 安装 udev 规则，授予权限："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:178
msgid ""
"Then unplug and reconnect the SpaceMouse, and log out and back in so the new"
" group membership applies. The rule grants access to the user on the local "
"seat (``uaccess``) and to members of ``plugdev``, rather than to every "
"account on the machine; the ``plugdev`` membership is what makes it work "
"over SSH, where there is no local seat. Older 3Dconnexion models such as the"
" SpaceNavigator for Notebooks enumerate under the Logitech vendor id, so "
"replace ``256f`` with ``046d`` for those."
msgstr ""
"然后拔下并重新连接 SpaceMouse，注销后重新登录，使新的用户组成员资格生效。该规则仅授权本地会话用户（ ``uaccess`` ）及 "
"``plugdev`` 成员，而非机器上的所有账户。通过 SSH 使用时没有本地会话，正是 ``plugdev`` "
"成员资格提供了访问权限。SpaceNavigator for Notebooks 等较旧的 3Dconnexion 型号使用 Logitech 厂商 "
"ID，请将 ``256f`` 改为 ``046d`` 。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:184
msgid ""
"We recommend using local deployment of Isaac Lab to use the SpaceMouse. If "
"using container deployment (:ref:`deployment-docker`), you must give the "
"``isaac-lab-base`` container access to the USB bus by mounting it and "
"allowing its device cgroup in your ``docker-compose.yaml`` file:"
msgstr ""
"使用 SpaceMouse 时建议在本地部署 Isaac Lab。如果使用容器部署（ :ref:`deployment-docker` ），必须在 "
"``docker-compose.yaml`` 中挂载 USB 总线，并通过设备 cgroup 规则允许 ``isaac-lab-base`` "
"容器访问："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:194
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports the SpaceMouse Compact, SpaceMouse Wireless and "
"SpaceNavigator for Notebooks from 3Dconnexion. SE(3) teleoperation "
"additionally supports the SpaceNavigator and the 3Dconnexion Universal "
"Receiver."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 支持 3Dconnexion 的 SpaceMouse Compact、SpaceMouse Wireless 和 "
"SpaceNavigator for Notebooks。SE(3) 遥操作还支持 SpaceNavigator 及 3Dconnexion "
"Universal Receiver。"

