#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:284
msgid ""
"The order of the stacked cubes should be blue (bottom), red (middle), green "
"(top)."
msgstr "堆叠立方体的顺序应为蓝色（底部）、红色（中间）、绿色（顶部）。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:286
msgid "Tips for collecting good demonstrations:"
msgstr "采集高质量示范的建议："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:288
msgid ""
"Keep demonstrations short. Shorter demonstrations mean fewer decisions for "
"the policy, making training easier."
msgstr "保持演示简短。简短的演示意味着策略需要做出的决策更少，从而使训练变得更容易。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:289
msgid "Take a direct path and move efficiently toward the goal."
msgstr "沿直接路径高效移动到目标。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:290
msgid ""
"Do not have extended pauses. Instead, perform smooth, continuous motions. It"
" is not obvious for a policy why and when to pause, hence continuous motions"
" are easier to learn."
msgstr "避免长时间停顿，尽量保持平滑、连续的运动。策略很难判断何时以及为何应停顿，因此连续运动更易学习。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:292
msgid ""
"If a mistake is made while performing a demonstration, press the ``R`` key "
"(if using a keyboard) or the right button (if using a SpaceMouse) to discard"
" the current demonstration and reset to a new starting position."
msgstr "如果示范中出现操作失误，键盘用户可按 ``R`` ，SpaceMouse 用户可按右侧按钮，丢弃当前示范并重置到新的起始位置。"

