#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:330
msgid "Generate Additional Synthetic Demonstrations"
msgstr "生成更多合成示范"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:332
msgid ""
"In the following example, we will show how to use Isaac Lab Mimic to "
"generate additional demonstrations that can be used to train either a state-"
"based policy (using the ``Isaac-Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-Rel-Mimic-v0`` "
"environment) or visuomotor policy (using the ``Isaac-Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-"
"Rel-Visuomotor-Mimic-v0`` environment) to teach a Franka robot to stack "
"cubes."
msgstr ""
"以下示例介绍如何通过 Isaac Lab Mimic 生成额外示范，训练基于状态的策略（使用 ``Isaac-Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-"
"Rel-Mimic-v0`` 环境）或视觉运动策略（使用 ``Isaac-Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-Rel-Visuomotor-"
"Mimic-v0`` 环境），让 Franka 机器人学会堆叠立方体。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:336
msgid ""
"Before generating additional demonstrations, the human demonstrations must "
"first be annotated to define the boundary of each subtask. Subtasks are "
"defined for each end-effector (eef) and are segments in the demonstrations "
"where the eef is performing an action relative to a specific object. Any "
"time the target object of the eef changes, a new subtask begins. For "
"example, in the stacking task, the first subtask is to grasp the red cube "
"(eef motion is dictated by the red cube), while the second subtask is to "
"stack the red cube on top of the blue cube (eef motion is dictated by the "
"blue cube). Subtasks can be annotated manually or (if the environment "
"supports it) automatically using heuristics. For this tutorial, our "
"environment supports automatic annotation which will be used in the "
"following step."
msgstr ""
"生成额外示范前，必须先标注人类示范，确定各子任务的边界。子任务分别针对每个末端执行器（eef）定义，是末端相对于特定物体执行动作的示范片段。末端的目标物体每次变化，都会开始新的子任务。例如，堆叠任务的第一个子任务是抓取红色立方体（末端运动由红色立方体决定），第二个是将红色立方体堆到蓝色立方体上（末端运动由蓝色立方体决定）。可以手动标注，也可以在环境支持时通过启发式规则自动标注。本教程环境支持自动标注，下一步将采用这种方式。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/teleop_imitation.rst:345
msgid ""
